&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMark1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(※２)税務上の繰越欠損金は、法定実効税率を乗じた額であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMark1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:32.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-14.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18.3pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18.3pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18.3pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;２．法定実効税率と税効果会計適用後の法人税等の負担率との間に重要な差異があるときの、当該差異の原因となった主要な項目別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;
